#7701
The Entrance to the MerKingdom~
As you enter, you notice that your breath leaves your body.  Strangely,
though, you do not have any desire to breathe.  A signpost is here, bearing
a short message.  Fish and human-like creatures are swimming around peacefully,
yielding a serene atmosphere.  Your presence does not seem to frighten them in
any way.  Nonetheless, you notice that these creatures are avoiding certain
areas of their realm carefully.~
77 ROOM_INDOORS SECT_WATER_SWIM
DDIR_NORTH
~
~
0 -1 7710
DDIR_UP
You can barely see the water above where you entered this lovely kingdom.~
~
0 -1 17806
E
sign signpost~
The sign reads:
Welcome to our lovely kingdom.  We hope that you will enjoy your visit or
residence in our world.  Please beware of some of our creatures, however.
They do not represent our city in any other capacity than that they live here.

Best wishes from us to you in our world.

                                           The MerKingdom Council of Relations~
S
#7702
Inside the Whirlpool~
You are trapped inside the whirlpool, and there is virtually no chance
that you will be able to get back upwards to where you came.  The eye of the
whirlpool, which you see below you, leads downward to what appears to be much
safer waters.~
