#7750
Coral Reef~
All you can see is coral.  It has grown up high enough to form a sort 
of wall and an overhang.  It looks really fragile, so fragile that if you
make a sudden movement or loud noise the whole thing will come crashing
down.  The only exit you can see is to the east, but it is very dark.  
You wonder what is lurking just beyond the light.
There is a note stuck to a piece of coral that is jutting out of the wall.~
