#7752
A Dead End~
As you walk westward, a small slab of rock behind you shuts,
blocking off all light.  Behind the slab you hear the giggling of the marine
creatures you passed at the resting place.  There is no way back.  You hear 
loud, hurried noises as you move farther eastward.~
