#7753
Inferno~
You swim inside the volcano, and to your chagrin, the temperature only
rises.  Fortunately, there is a small opening in the volcano wall to
the south, obviously created by the inhabitants of this kingdom.  It leads
you back to a bluish, safe waters.  Also you notice that you could
probably still swim back up to the top of the volcano.  You will have to
race the eruption to do so, however.~
