Pandora's Hideout~
As you enter this room, you notice a complete change of environment.
The volcano eruption is not even noticeable to this quiet, simple room.
The room is a standard room, yet it apparently lies in the middle of the
water.  You sense that some forces beyond this dimension are in control here.
It might be safer to leave to the north, where you can see the water again.~
